    "turn_text": "I think you knew all that way before we ever met, but I'm gonna start where I always start when it comes to you and this because it's the place you least want to start, you were an elite level wrestler. And I don't mean like pretty good. I don't mean wore a letter jacket in high school and his way class. I mean, all American good. I think, even though you hate to talk about this, I think you beat a guy maybe named John Smith that like nobody else ever beat and I can see how uncomfortable you are right now with me bringing this up. So I'm not going to ask you about beating John Smith. I will ask you, did wrestling have anything to do with how you prepare for other parts of life?",
