    "turn_text": "No, I'm going to ask you about something that's a lot scarier than that and how you handled it. So the mainstream media will portray you and some others as just being hopelessly devoted to Donald Trump, just sick of phantically devoted. You correct me if I'm wrong, but there was a health care bill when we were in the house that he kind of was warm on maybe not super warm but he liked it and you did not. And I think for a period of time, he was pretty vocal in his lack of pleasure with the Republicans who did not support that health care bill. Do I have that right? And I never saw you flinch.",
